"\nPush to talk from a system shortcut: ptt-down on key press and ptt-up on release\n(Settings → Voice → Push to talk). Needs Settings → Advanced → External control on.\nExits with 0 when it worked, 1 when it didn't.\nLARPER_CTL=1 on both sides talks to a demo (--demo) started with it.\nExamples (Hyprland, Sway, KDE, GNOME, waybar, polybar, Windows): docs/ctl.md\n" "\nPush to talk from a system shortcut: ptt-down on key press and ptt-up on release\n(Settings → Voice → Push to talk). Needs Settings → Advanced → External control on.\nExits with 0 when it worked, 1 when it didn't.\nLARPER_CTL=1 on both sides talks to a demo (--demo) started with it.\nExamples (Hyprland, Sway, KDE, GNOME, waybar, polybar, Windows): docs/ctl.md\n"
