"Covers its ears at ALL CAPS, covers its eyes at a ||spoiler||, puts on glasses to review a code block, holds a scroll for a long message (and pulls back worried near the limit), points at the lists for @ and #, opens a tiny terminal for / at the start and offers tea when you delete a lot. And it has a few secrets. All worked out from the text on your computer." "Covers its ears at ALL CAPS, covers its eyes at a ||spoiler||, puts on glasses to review a code block, holds a scroll for a long message (and pulls back worried near the limit), points at the lists for @ and #, opens a tiny terminal for / at the start and offers tea when you delete a lot. And it has a few secrets. All worked out from the text on your computer."
