"When a new version is found, it downloads and installs in the background; it opens the next time the app starts. Only versions with the right signature go in." "When a new version is found, it downloads and installs in the background; it opens the next time the app starts. Only versions with the right signature go in."
"when inside when" "when inside when"
"When a game from the list is running, your status shows \"Playing …\" with the time played, like the Discord desktop app. Works for games without Rich Presence. Off: nothing looks at your processes." "When a game from the list is running, your status shows \"Playing …\" with the time played, like the Discord desktop app. Works for games without Rich Presence. Off: nothing looks at your processes."
"When off, links are only underlined on hover." "Если выключено, ссылки подчёркиваются только при наведении курсора."
"When someone mentions you, it shows up here." "Когда кто-то упоминает вас, это отображается здесь."
"When you leave it alone, it does things on its own now and then: drinks coffee, reads, fishes an emoji out of the chat, chases a fly, stacks blocks. Only while the window is focused and only for a few seconds; after a few idle minutes it falls asleep and stops using anything." "When you leave it alone, it does things on its own now and then: drinks coffee, reads, fishes an emoji out of the chat, chases a fly, stacks blocks. Only while the window is focused and only for a few seconds; after a few idle minutes it falls asleep and stops using anything."
