"With the pointer resting near it, it tries to grab it; resting on top of it, it sits on it (and falls when you move)." "With the pointer resting near it, it tries to grab it; resting on top of it, it sits on it (and falls when you move)."
"With the text box unfocused (Esc leaves it), the keys below navigate." "Когда текстовое поле не в фокусе (Esc выводит из него), для навигации служат клавиши ниже."
"With the window unfocused, it waits; if you're gone a long time, it sets up camp. When you come back, it runs to the mouse (and, after hours away, says it missed you)." "With the window unfocused, it waits; if you're gone a long time, it sets up camp. When you come back, it runs to the mouse (and, after hours away, says it missed you)."
"Without a notification server on D-Bus, they go out through notify-send, without buttons." "Without a notification server on D-Bus, they go out through notify-send, without buttons."
